  "description": {
    "en": "Toroline O-TORO Spin is a more aggressively shaped evolution of the original O-TORO developed by Steve Johnson. It changes the profile from six-sided to pentagonal, increasing mechanical ball grip, bite and launch angle while retaining the comfortable flex and elasticity of the original O-TORO platform. The higher trajectory creates greater net clearance and heavy topspin, making O-TORO Spin particularly suitable for aggressive baseline players and players seeking additional kick on second serves. It is available in Neon Green, Neon Pink, Lavender and White at 1.23 mm / 17 gauge.",

    "zh": "Toroline O-TORO Spin 是 Steve Johnson 基于原版 O-TORO 开发的更激进旋转版本。它将原本的六边形结构改为五边形 Pentagonal 截面，从而进一步增加机械咬球、Ball Bite 和 Launch Angle，同时保留原版 O-TORO 标志性的舒适 Flex 与弹性。更高的出球弧线能够带来更大的过网高度和更重的 Topspin，非常适合站在底线高速完整挥拍的重上旋球员，同时对二发 Kick Serve 也非常有帮助。产品规格为 1.23 毫米 / 17，提供 Neon Green、Neon Pink、Lavender 和 White 四种颜色。"
  },

